{"real": true, "dur": 40.99, "sent": [{"start": 0.22, "end": 3.58, "text": "Wilkins was working on a framework for European languages.", "words": [{"w": "Wilkins", "s": 0.22}, {"w": "was", "s": 0.78}, {"w": "working", "s": 1.06}, {"w": "on", "s": 1.5}, {"w": "a", "s": 1.66}, {"w": "framework", "s": 1.8}, {"w": "for", "s": 2.36}, {"w": "European", "s": 2.6}, {"w": "languages.", "s": 3.0}]}, {"start": 4.48, "end": 8.78, "text": "But could the same principles work for a language as different as Chinese?", "words": [{"w": "But", "s": 4.48}, {"w": "could", "s": 4.76}, {"w": "the", "s": 4.98}, {"w": "same", "s": 5.26}, {"w": "principles", "s": 5.56}, {"w": "work", "s": 6.28}, {"w": "for", "s": 6.56}, {"w": "a", "s": 6.72}, {"w": "language", "s": 6.84}, {"w": "as", "s": 7.42}, {"w": "different", "s": 7.64}, {"w": "as", "s": 8.06}, {"w": "Chinese?", "s": 8.26}]}, {"start": 9.76, "end": 12.06, "text": "That’s the question I want to look at today.", "words": [{"w": "That’s", "s": 9.76}, {"w": "the", "s": 10.04}, {"w": "question", "s": 10.2}, {"w": "I", "s": 10.8}, {"w": "want", "s": 10.9}, {"w": "to", "s": 11.12}, {"w": "look", "s": 11.28}, {"w": "at", "s": 11.48}, {"w": "today.", "s": 11.66}]}, {"start": 12.48, "end": 17.8, "text": "Can a platform built for French work for Chinese, a language that’s so different?", "words": [{"w": "Can", "s": 12.48}, {"w": "a", "s": 12.66}, {"w": "platform", "s": 12.8}, {"w": "built", "s": 13.46}, {"w": "for", "s": 13.72}, {"w": "French", "s": 13.98}, {"w": "work", "s": 14.82}, {"w": "for", "s": 15.06}, {"w": "Chinese,", "s": 15.26}, {"w": "a", "s": 16.2}, {"w": "language", "s": 16.32}, {"w": "that’s", "s": 16.96}, {"w": "so", "s": 17.18}, {"w": "different?", "s": 17.4}]}, {"start": 18.72, "end": 22.44, "text": "And if so, what can stay the same, and what has to change?", "words": [{"w": "And", "s": 18.72}, {"w": "if", "s": 18.96}, {"w": "so,", "s": 19.16}, {"w": "what", "s": 19.8}, {"w": "can", "s": 20.0}, {"w": "stay", "s": 20.24}, {"w": "the", "s": 20.46}, {"w": "same,", "s": 20.64}, {"w": "and", "s": 21.3}, {"w": "what", "s": 21.5}, {"w": "has", "s": 21.72}, {"w": "to", "s": 21.9}, {"w": "change?", "s": 22.06}]}, {"start": 22.94, "end": 28.04, "text": "I’ll start with the French course, then look at what makes Chinese different.", "words": [{"w": "I’ll", "s": 22.94}, {"w": "start", "s": 23.2}, {"w": "with", "s": 23.68}, {"w": "the", "s": 23.9}, {"w": "French", "s": 24.08}, {"w": "course,", "s": 24.48}, {"w": "then", "s": 25.44}, {"w": "look", "s": 25.7}, {"w": "at", "s": 26.0}, {"w": "what", "s": 26.28}, {"w": "makes", "s": 26.6}, {"w": "Chinese", "s": 26.96}, {"w": "different.", "s": 27.56}]}, {"start": 28.5, "end": 40.32, "text": "I’ll show you how the same approach can be adapted, using examples from both textbooks, and finish with some steps you can try with your own language.", "words": [{"w": "I’ll", "s": 28.5}, {"w": "show", "s": 28.74}, {"w": "you", "s": 29.02}, {"w": "how", "s": 29.62}, {"w": "the", "s": 29.82}, {"w": "same", "s": 30.04}, {"w": "approach", "s": 30.34}, {"w": "can", "s": 31.22}, {"w": "be", "s": 31.38}, {"w": "adapted,", "s": 31.56}, {"w": "using", "s": 32.7}, {"w": "examples", "s": 33.04}, {"w": "from", "s": 34.18}, {"w": "both", "s": 34.48}, {"w": "textbooks,", "s": 34.88}, {"w": "and", "s": 36.1}, {"w": "finish", "s": 36.36}, {"w": "with", "s": 36.88}, {"w": "some", "s": 37.14}, {"w": "steps", "s": 37.46}, {"w": "you", "s": 38.22}, {"w": "can", "s": 38.34}, {"w": "try", "s": 38.58}, {"w": "with", "s": 39.2}, {"w": "your", "s": 39.4}, {"w": "own", "s": 39.58}, {"w": "language.", "s": 39.82}]}]}